   '2024-04-25', null, '2026-10-18T00:00:00Z', '706b34928313acb742f318a0d6228dd68848ec49e0e1f02c4db6fe867a1a91f9', 'extracted', 'unreviewed', 'Date basis: printed in the running title. Imported for 50A: the grade-by-grade development sections (O-3, O-4, O-5, O-6) as the pamphlet gives them for the branch or functional area; they apply to every AOC listed. Duties and prerequisites are not imported from this pamphlet (DA PAM 611-21 is the source); figures and tables are not extracted. The Regular Army individual development run (page 5 on) is imported; the Army Reserve (page 9 on) and National Guard (page 14 on) runs are not. LIMITATIONS: The Regular Army individual development run (page 5 on) is imported; the Army Reserve (page 9 on) and National Guard (page 14 on) runs are not.', 'pdf-parse 2.4.5', 'army-600-3-fa-50-da-pam-600-3-25-apr-24@2026-10-18', '4d516fce6a00ff6c1d993aff71cce1ed353047d07756cfc40986c63f7ae75584')
